WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:17.309
♪♪

00:00:17.309 --> 00:00:19.353
Antoine Fuqua:
I thought I knew a lot about
slavery.

00:00:19.519 --> 00:00:22.064
Antoine Fuqua:
You know obviously being a black
man growing up in this country.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:24.233
♪♪

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:26.235
Antoine Fuqua:
But when you really get in it
this deep.

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:27.986
♪♪

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:31.198
Antoine Fuqua:
The idea of Peter running.
Trying to find his way.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:34.576
Antoine Fuqua:
Imagine, no lights,

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:35.577
Antoine Fuqua:
no food.

00:00:35.619 --> 00:00:37.621
♪♪

00:00:37.621 --> 00:00:39.039
Antoine Fuqua:
On the run being hunted.

00:00:39.957 --> 00:00:40.958
Man:
Is he coming?

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:45.295
♪♪

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:47.464
It's definitely changed me
forever.

00:00:47.881 --> 00:01:02.145
♪♪

00:01:02.145 --> 00:01:03.939
We got 400 years of pain.

00:01:04.398 --> 00:01:05.399
Antoine Fuqua:
Of emotion.

00:01:06.233 --> 00:01:08.902
Antoine Fuqua:
Each take, we should be bringing
that to the table.

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:17.786
♪♪

